;; The recursive ternary cycle: every body occurrence is dynamic in the SCC,
;; so the _maint4neg sweep and the _maint1 rebuild both carry the join3
;; action (docs/wcoj.md §15, docs/m4t-contract.md).  tedge is both the
;; edited input and the recursive head, exercising the foundation-aware
;; overlay in front of a join3 sweep.

table (tedge int int)

rule
(tedge A B)
(tedge B C)
(tedge A C)
-->
(tedge C A)
